Actually no, I don't think the game has been designed around the
unicorn horn's existence.  I think it's fairly obvious that the item
was just added to the game without much thought given to it.  Like a
lot of things in the game, it was just added.

Like crysknives, which were once a formidable weapon but are now
barely remembered.  Like most colors of dragon scale mail, which never
see use unless they're one of two colors (even black is severely
deprecated since silver protects against disintegration at least as
well).  Like four our of five non-quest artifacts, including Sting and
Orcrist, which were among the first in the game.

And even if there is a special place in the design that needs the
horn, that's not to say it can't be redesigned to remedy its place of
honor.

